  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Civil Society Organisations&#xbf; Capacities in Response to COVID-19 in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;Overall objective(s) (i.e. Impact): To contribute to social protection of vulnerable sections most adversely affected by the impact of COVID 19 in India&lt;Specific objective(s) (i.e. Outcome(s): CSOs and affected local communities, particularly unorganized workers, have enhanced capacities and resilience to respond to the Covid 19 crisis through access to public entitlements, social safety nets and socio-economic rehabilitation.</narrative>
  </description>
